        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Asei kandi maan ni pui nung",
            "Kum the aniu tam mei hei,",
            "Raguang rui suaihiam ntang mei",
            "Tilou o mban thai khang .",
            "",
            "Ntam puni the aseic hei,",
            "Chun si zaeng sirui padik e",
            "Raguang rui nduang lou kandiu",
            "Aniu guai ntam sini.",
            "",
            "2. Aniu hei ntam kan sini",
            "Zailou o nang zau zianc rui,",
            "Gaeng lou mak mei lauziu na kum",
            "Pat lou rio aniu guay ta.",
            "",
            "3. Zianc mei nun tan ntam lana",
            "Chunsi zaeng sirui padik e",
            "Ntam lou mei zaeng si mik dui",
            "He raguang thut phui lou o.",
            "",
            "4. Ravguangc rui zauzianc mei lung khou,",
            "Neihlana bam chamv datni,",
            "Tingkao kandih guangc tang pukhou,",
            "Salak khe chunsi salam ."
          ]
        }
      }
